OL,3,GNEWSAChildren still living in
OL,4,Aunregistered homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a dozen young people in
OL,7,FLiverpool are living in unregistered
OL,8,Fchildren's homes.
OL,10,FIn England, all children's homes must
OL,11,Fregister with Ofsted. Operating an
OL,12,Funregistered home is illegal.
OL,14,FIn July, it was revealed #120m was
OL,15,Fspent by local authorities across
OL,16,FMerseyside in the last year on private
OL,17,Fchildren's homes - with some of that
OL,18,Fmoney being paid to house children in
OL,19,Funregistered, illegal settings.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
